device-tree and binding parts.

Adjustments for v7.2.5:
- arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile: the 6.17 hunk expected
  sm8475-nothing-pong/diting/yudi lines that are absent in v7.2.5; the
  sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin.dtb entry is added after the sm8450 boards instead.
- sm8475.dtsi: dropped upstream (still absent in v7.2.5), content taken
  verbatim from sm8450-mainline next branch, then the downstream
  modifications applied (applied cleanly).
- Dropped hunks: none in this group besides the Makefile context rewrite.

