+	/*
+	 * The charger PD runs on ADSP and publishes PMIC_RTR_ADSP_APPS, exactly
+	 * as the vendor FDT describes. Keep USB role wiring out of this first
+	 * step: battmgr and UCSI may report state, while the already-validated
+	 * DWC3 peripheral gadget remains the only control/data path.
