+	/*
+	 * The four CS35L41 speaker amps have no VA-supply / VP-supply in the
+	 * vendor tree the bootloader hands over (abl-final-fdt.dts:13410-13620).
+	 * The rails are hard-wired. Mainline cs35l41_probe() still does a
+	 * regulator_bulk_get() for "VA" and "VP" and will not probe without
+	 * them; these always-on placeholders exist only to satisfy that API.
+	 * They have no GPIO and do not gate hardware. Voltages are the
+	 * datasheet-typical analog / battery rails, not a measured PMIC LDO.
